{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43606","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 永安坊永寿寺 闲中好 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 永安坊永寿寺 闲中好","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲中好，尽日松爲侣。\n此趣人不知，轻风度僧语。\n闲中好，尘务不萦心。\n坐对当窗木，看移三面阴。\n闲中好，幽磬度声迟。\n卷上论题肇，画中僧姓支。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}